        <mxCell id="build_note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontColor=#666666;" value="&lt;font size=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Your build commands (&lt;b&gt;./configure &amp;amp;&amp;amp; make&lt;/b&gt;) run exactly as before.&lt;br&gt;bomtrace3 is transparent — it just observes the compiler calls.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
