        <mxCell id="key_box" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#D4A800;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=5;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Key Points&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1.&lt;/b&gt; Only the build step changes — wrap it in &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;docker run&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&lt;/b&gt; Same source code, same build commands, same output binaries&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3.&lt;/b&gt; No source modifications — zero developer impact&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4.&lt;/b&gt; Container pulled from &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;containers.cisco.com&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5.&lt;/b&gt; Requires &lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;SYS_PTRACE&lt;/font&gt; capability (for build interception)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6.&lt;/b&gt; Outputs: SPDX 2.3 JSON SBOM per binary + interactive HTML visualization" vertex="1">
